-- Expands the "Suggested this month" catalog (003_SeedMealSuggestions.sql,
-- 004_ExpandMealSuggestions.sql) with 157 real recipes extracted from the
-- 13 free 7-day meal-plan PDFs at
-- https://www.promealplan.com/en/blog/free-meal-plan-templates (Weight
-- Loss, High Protein, Muscle Gain, Athletes, Cutting, Vegetarian, Vegan,
-- Balanced x3, Intermittent Fasting, Keto, Bulking). The PDFs themselves
-- are not stored or redistributed anywhere in this repo/app - only the
-- recipe names and their published per-serving macros were read out of
-- the downloaded files (via `pdftotext`) and transcribed below; each row's
-- Description credits the source plan(s).
--
-- Every 7-day plan repeats a handful of unique day patterns, so recipes
-- were de-duplicated by (title, kcal, protein, carbs, fat): the same
-- recipe served at the same portion in multiple plans becomes one row
-- (Description lists every plan it came from); the same recipe name
-- served at a different portion in another plan (e.g. "Protein Yogurt
-- With Granola and Fruits" at 267 vs. 343 vs. 513 kcal) becomes a
-- separate row with "(N kcal serving)" appended to the title so the two
-- don't collide under this seed's Title-based idempotency check.
--
-- All evergreen (SuggestedMonth NULL) - these aren't seasonal, unlike
-- 003/004's month-tagged flagships. Idempotent by Title - safe to re-run.
INSERT INTO dbo.MealSuggestions
    (Title, MealType, Description, CaloriesKcal, ProteinG, CarbsG, FatsG, SuggestedMonth, IsSystemDefault, SortOrder)
SELECT v.Title, v.MealType, v.Description, v.CaloriesKcal, v.ProteinG, v.CarbsG, v.FatsG, v.SuggestedMonth, 1, v.SortOrder
